    "Density holds 'LBS PER U.S. GAL @ 15.6 C 8.18' (Target), with 'LBS PER IMP GAL @ 15.6 C 9.82' as an alternate entry; 'SPECIFIC GRAVITY @ 15.6 C 0.961 0.981 1.001' is recorded in the optional specific_gravity property (2026-10-24).",
